<title>JAPAN: Izutsuya -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Izutsuya -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    35.06		vs	   36.20</p>
<p> Operating	  783    million	  vs	  788    million</p>
<p> Current	    177    million	  vs	  173    million</p>
<p> Net	     prft 3.60		vs     loss 6.61</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 42.69 yen	  vs    loss 78.37 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     84 million	  vs	  84 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Izutsuya Co Ltd is a regional department store affiliated with Nishi-Nippon Railroad Co Ltd.</p>
